{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_125_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_125","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_125_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_125","textTraditional":"二、夏，楚子、陳侯、鄭伯盟于辰陵。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_125_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_125","textTraditional":"三、公孫歸父會齊人伐莒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_125_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_125","textTraditional":"四、秋，晉侯會狄于櫕函。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_125_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_125","textTraditional":"五、冬十月，楚人殺陳夏徵舒","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_125_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_125","textTraditional":"此楚子也，其稱人何？貶。曷為貶？不與外討也。不與外討者，因其討乎外而不與也，雖內討亦不與也。曷為不與？實與而文不與。文曷為不與？諸侯之義不得專討也。諸侯之義不得專討，則其曰實與之何？上無天子，下無方伯，天下諸侯有為無道者，臣弒君，子弒父，力能討之，則討之可也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_125_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_125","textTraditional":"六、丁亥，楚子入陳，納公孫寧、儀行父于陳。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_125_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_125","textTraditional":"此皆大夫也，其言納何？納公黨與也。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}